  "notes": "From ⟦{縫|ぬ}う→縫う：00326_nuu⟧ (to sew) + ⟦{付|つ}ける→付ける：00761_tsukeru⟧ (to attach). Transitive: the thing sewn takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ and the cloth takes ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (A⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧B⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{縫|ぬ}い{付|つ}ける).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦ボタン→ボタン：02963_botan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{縫|ぬ}い{付|つ}ける: to sew on a button\n- ⟦{名札|なふだ}→名札：12338_nafuda⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{縫|ぬ}い{付|つ}ける: to sew on a name tag\n- ワッペン⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{縫|ぬ}い{付|つ}ける: to sew on a patch\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{付|つ}ける→付ける：00761_tsukeru⟧: to attach (in general)\n- ⟦{縫|ぬ}い{目|め}→縫い目：07102_nuime⟧: a seam, a stitch",
